126063198646","created_at":"2026-10-01T09:34:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105592126063198646"],"id":"2105592126063198646","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":413,"impression_count":1022595,"like_count":8313,"quote_count":20,"reply_count":458,"retweet_count":90},"text":"又突然想到自己曾经在黄片网站上看到一些侵犯未成年的，很恶心，太恶心了，我性欲全无只想吐。世界上真的会有这样的恶魔吗？那个女孩看起来也就十二三岁，甚至还有八九岁的。\n好恶心，真的会有对这种片子射/高潮的人吗？？？？","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2105592126063198646"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2105591683828289986","created_at":"2026-10-01T09:32:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105591683828289986"],"id":"2105591683828289986","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5040,"like_count":85,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"曾经看到那种ai换脸的黄片和几个视频剪辑在一起的黄片我都是直接略过。直到我刚看到了一个女生发现自己被ai换脸造黄谣维权的视频才猛然惊醒，这样的ai换脸让那些被换脸的女生承接了多少恶心恶俗的言语，甚至如果被身边朋友同事发现了可能会承接住更多的恶意。\n所以下次我会在略过之前点个举报和拉黑🫶","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2105591683828289986"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2105557957773496331","created_at":"2026-10-01T07:18:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105557957773496331"],"id":"2105557957773496331","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":11390,"like_count":120,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":1},"text":"“好孩子怎么连笨拙地勾引人也那么可爱”\n“虽然是第一次，但还是有很认真的学习黄片里的姿势来服侍爸爸”\n“虽然很笨拙很青涩但还是让爸爸硬了呢”\n“爸爸会认真品尝你的，乖女儿”","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2105557957773496331"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2105557014571274706","created_at":"2026-10-01T07:14:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105557014571274706"],"id":"2105557014571274706","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":14450,"like_count":140,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":2},"text":"如果爸爸是自己的老师的话也会很爽的吧。上课的时候塞上跳蛋，回答问题的时候加大频率。下课就要去办公室，去厕所，给爸爸口交挨操。\n“妮妮真不愧是老师的好学生，不管学习学得好，就连服侍老师的鸡巴也服侍的那么好”","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2105557014571274706"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2105556411522654383","created_at":"2026-10-01T07:12:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105556411522654383"],"id":"2105556411522654383","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":141,"impression_count":94547,"like_count":1336,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":94,"retweet_count":57},"text":"我的道德和我的xp依旧在打架。好想被爸爸强奸。想要早上迷迷糊糊地睁眼就是被爸爸当作飞机杯操。在家里为了方便给爸爸使用只能穿开裆裤，奶子是一定要露出来的，给爸爸在无聊的时候揉揉扇扇解闷。好想在外面玩的时候被爸爸拉去厕所强奸，好想当个合格的飞机杯给爸爸使用。\n爸爸🥹","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2105556411522654383"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2105555700256580095","created_at":"2026-10-01T07:09:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105555700256580095"],"id":"2105555700256580095","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":144238,"like_count":190,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":86,"retweet_count":4},"text":"春药这种东西用了会有什么可怕的副作用吗？如果抛弃一些身体健康精神健康什么的，真的好想试试用春药，想看自己会骚成什么样子……","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2105555700256580095"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2105555037426717161","created_at":"2026-10-01T07:06:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105555037426717161"],"id":"2105555037426717161","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2853,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2104653791589216767","type":"quoted"}],"text":"韩国吗？好吧。 https://t.co/yqG2otiLzl","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2105555037426717161"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2105553829202964538","created_at":"2026-10-01T07:02:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2105553829202964538"],"id":"2105553829202964538","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2162,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"邪恶的相亲角自介居然伪装成bdsm自介试图攻击我","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2105553829202964538"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conver